Native compiler declaration compatibility and owner-authorized audio-only THP diagnostic.

Upstream-base: 9046e67aa2077a7eb4ed6e28c9df3c1d3b368f84
The normal native and console profiles retain every original video request.
MSCHARGED_DIAGNOSTIC_THP_AUDIO_ONLY omits only the named texture lookups and
VideoDecode requests for supported standalone mode0 diagnostics. Remove that
gate when genuine original MovieInit(1)/AX and movie textures are ready.
The critical-section declarations expose existing genuine native SDK providers.

